"releaseNotes":"The Wellthy app has a fresh new look! This update makes it even easier to connect with your Care Coordinator, check in on care projects, and manage backup care events on the go.", "version":"5.0.0", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"With Wellthy, you’ve always got a care expert in your corner. We handle the hard stuff - managing logistics, solving problems, and easing stress - so you can focus on living your best life.\u2028No care challenge is too big or too small. \n\nNeed help making a doctor’s appointment? Scrambling to find a babysitter? Trying to wrap your head around a new diagnosis? Not sure where to start with finding a living facility for an elderly parent? Wellthy’s expert Care Team is here to help with all of these tasks and more. We’ve helped hundreds of thousands of people navigate complex care journeys over the last 10 years, and we bring that wealth of knowledge and ability to get things done to every family we serve.\n\nThe best part? If your employer or health plan covers Wellthy, you can access our full range of services at no cost. \n\nHere are just a few of the areas where Wellthy can help you and the people you love:\n\n— Caring for elderly or aging loved ones — \nWe’ll be your partner in navigating every aspect of aging and eldercare - from finding and coordinating in-home support, housing, or medical specialists, to arranging transportation, meal delivery, and financial assistance. \n\n— Finding reliable childcare — \nWe’ll help you find and arrange the right childcare for your family - whether it’s ongoing care, occasional help, or last-minute backup care. \n\n— Starting a family — \nWe’re here to support you through every step of starting or expanding your family - from exploring fertility options and adoption to preparing for a new child’s arrival. Our support is inclusive of all paths to parenthood. \n\n— Complex care and disability — \nManaging complex care needs or disability can feel overwhelming, but Wellthy makes it easier by coordinating providers, therapies, in-home support, medication regimens, and specialized equipment.\n\n— End of life and loss — \nOur care experts can support your family through life’s hardest moments, from navigating end-of-life planning to handling the practical details after losing a loved one. We can help arrange hospice care, manage paperwork and logistics, and connect you with grief resources.\n\n— Supporting mental health and wellness — \nWe make it easier to prioritize your family’s mental health and wellness by connecting you with trusted therapists, programs, and resources. We’ll guide you through options and handle all the logistics.\n\n— Managing the costs of care — \nWe help you navigate medical expenses by organizing bills, explaining coverage, and identifying financial aid. We can also advocate on your behalf with insurance and providers, including appealing claim denials to reduce your family’s costs.\n\n— Hands-on support in times of crisis — \nIn moments of crisis - whether it’s a natural disaster, a medical emergency, or an unexpected hospitalization - we step in to lighten your load. We can coordinate urgent care, arrange safe housing or transportation, manage hospital transitions, and handle time-sensitive paperwork so you can focus on your loved ones.\n\n—And those are just a few of the areas where Wellthy is here to help. \n\nDownload the app now to get started! \n\n\n—\n\nNeed help or have a question? Contact us here: https://wellthy.com/contact\n\n- Use of the Wellthy app requires a Wellthy account. Learn more about Wellthy at wellthy.com, or ask your employer / health plan if Wellthy is a benefit available to you.\n- Services (Care Concierge, Backup Care, Care Planning, Community) available to members are dependent on what their specific employer or health plan provides. We do not guarantee access to all services for all members.\n- Private-pay memberships are available for individuals who are not sponsored by an employer or health plan. Learn more at https://wellthy.com/plans\n\n—\n\n- Privacy Policy: https://wellthy.com/privacy\n- Terms of Service: https://wellthy.com/terms", "trackCensoredName":"Wellthy", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/wellthy/id1498121212?uo=4", "averageUserRating":3.7826100000000000278532752417959272861480712890625, "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "artistId":1498121211, "artistName":"Wellthy Inc.", "genres":["Health & Fitness", "Medical"], "userRatingCount":23}, 
